<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz January inflation slows to 3.4 pct vs Dec.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz January inflation slows to 3.4 pct vs Dec.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's January inflation rate slowed to 3.4 percent from December's 4.5 percent last year, the National Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ CONSUMER PRICE INFLATION  Jan 97   Dec 96    Jan 96</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	    +3.4     +4.5	+3.6</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
